msgid "category:general-settings/description"
msgstr ""
"[Enable]" allows you to switch between using the function individually.\n\n"
"[Animation] can be enabled to dynamically control the item from ExMenu in VRChat.\n"
"If you disable this, the [Initial value] described below becomes a parameter called [Override value], and you can unify the settings of the material to which LLC is applied.\n\n"
"[Initial Value] is the value that is initialized when the avatar is reset.\n\n"
"[Override Value] is the value that commonizes the material settings when not controlling by animation.\n\n"
"[Operating Range] is the range of values that are operated within the range of 0 to 100% in the menu.\n\n"
"[Synced] is the value for whether to synchronize the parameter. If asynchronous is okay, you can reduce the load by turning this setting OFF.\n\n"
"[Saved] is the value for whether to save the parameter. If it is turned OFF, it will be initialized when moving to another world or switching avatars."

