## カラー設定

msgid "category:color-control/description"
msgstr ""
"Settings related to overall color control.\n"
"For lilToon, this operation does not apply to Main Color 2nd. If you want to modify it, consider baking textures.\n\n"
"[Hue], [Saturation], [Brightness], and [Gamma] are the primary features.\n"
"Adjusting these parameters allows you to change the color of the avatar."

msgid "category:color-control/texture-bake-information"
msgstr ""
"Enabling color settings uses LLC for operations, so any changes to Main Color should be baked into the texture.\n"
"Baking may increase texture memory usage. If significant increases occur, consider reviewing material settings or using tools like TexTransTool for atlas creation."


msgid "category:color-control/tips"
msgstr ""
"When using lilToon, saturation, hue, brightness, and gamma cannot be disabled individually because they are controlled by a single shader parameter.\n"
"Therefore, if any of them is enabled, the other disabled items will be overwritten with their override values."

