## lilToon Shadow

msgid "category:lilToon/shadow/description"
msgstr ""
"Settings specific to lilToon.\n\n"
"[Receive Shadow] controls the shadow settings' [Receive Shadow] for shadow colors 1/2/3 together."

msgid "settings:lilToon/shadow/receive-cast-shadow/label"
msgstr "Receive Shadow"

msgid "settings:lilToon/shadow/receive-cast-shadow/description"
msgstr ""
"Controls [Receive Shadow] in the shadow settings for shadow colors 1/2/3 together.\n\n"
"Control Parameter\n"
"lilToon:_ShadowReceive, _Shadow2ndReceive, _Shadow3rdReceive"

msgid "settings:lilToon/shadow/receive-cast-shadow/caution"
msgstr ""
"When this option is enabled, the default value (0) means the avatar will not receive any cast shadows from the world.\n"
"If you want to receive shadows, set the initial value to 1."

