## lilToon Distance Fade

msgid "category:lilToon/distance-fade/description"
msgstr ""
"Settings specific to lilToon.\n\n"
"[Distance Fade] controls fading based on the distance of the avatar.\n"
"As the avatar moves further away, it fades, allowing adjustments to its appearance.\n\n"
"[Start Distance] adjusts the start distance for distance fade.\n"
"[End Distance] adjusts the end distance for distance fade.\n"
"[Strength] adjusts the strength of distance fade.\n"
"[Color] adjusts the color for distance fade.\n"
"[Force Backface Shadow] toggles whether the backface is shaded.\n\n"
"Animation control is disabled by default, so enable it if needed.\n"
"If animation control is not used, [Override Value] will be used to apply common material settings.\n"
"This is convenient for applying settings to entire avatars in bulk."

msgid "category:lilToon/distance-fade/tips"
msgstr ""
"Each distance fade item, except for [Force Backface Shadow], is controlled by a single shader parameter and cannot be disabled individually.\n"
"Therefore, if any of them is enabled, the other disabled items will be overwritten with their override values."

