msgid "category:lilToon/backlight/description"
msgstr ""
"Settings specific to lilToon.\n\n"
"[Use Backlight] toggles whether backlight is used.\n"
"Using backlight allows light to be applied from behind the avatar.\n\n"
"[Backlight Color] adjusts the color of the backlight.\n"
"[Main Color Strength] adjusts the strength of the main color for the backlight.\n"
"[Range] adjusts the range of the backlight.\n"
"[Blur] adjusts the blur of the backlight.\n"
"[Directivity] adjusts the directivity of the backlight.\n"
"[View Direction Influence] adjusts the influence of view direction on the backlight.\n"
"[Receive Shadow] toggles whether the backlight receives shadows from the world.\n"
